            {
              "n": 4,
              "text": "<i>telophase I</i><br>chromosomes reach the opposite, poles / centrosomes / centrioles / end of cell<br><b>or</b><br>chromosomes decondense / chromatin formation / chromosomes become diffuse <b>;</b>",
